'''Ellie-Jean Coffey''' (25 November 1994) is an [[Australians|Australian]] model, [[softcore pornography|softcore]] actress and professional [[Surfing|surfer]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.worldsurfleague.com/athletes/2324/ellie-jean-coffey|title=Pro Surfer: Ellie-Jean Coffey|access-date=2016-09-15}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Yahoo TV - Watch Now|url=https://au.tv.yahoo.com/sunrise/video/watch/21916131/surfer-using-sex-appeal-to-boost-her-career/#page1|access-date=2016-09-15}}</ref>

== Early life ==
The eldest of seven, Coffey (originally from the Gold Coast of Queensland)<ref name="Mychajlowycz">{{Cite web|last=Mychajlowycz|first=Kasia|date=2013-08-28|title=Your Instagram Woman of the Week: Surfer Ellie-Jean Coffey|url=https://www.esquire.com/blogs/culture/ellie-jean-coffey-instagram-photos|access-date=2021-12-17|website=Esquire|language=en-US}}</ref> spent her childhood traveling around Australia with her family. Both her parents were keen surfers, and for 10 years they travelled Australia, while being home schooled. During this time she learned to surf and decided to become a professional surfer.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://thelens.surfstitch.com/2016/01/22/meet-the-family-the-coffeys/|title=Meet the Family: The Coffeys|website=The Lens|access-date=10 March 2017|archive-date=12 March 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170312052206/http://thelens.surfstitch.com/2016/01/22/meet-the-family-the-coffeys/|url-status=dead}}</ref> The family regularly attended surfing competitions, which Ellie-Jean entered and eventually started doing well at<ref name=":1">{{Cite web|date=2016-06-20|title=How pro surfer Ellie-Jean Coffey keeps breaking the internet|url=https://www.mensjournal.com/adventure/how-pro-surfer-ellie-jean-coffey-keeps-breaking-the-internet/|access-date=2021-12-17|website=Men's Journal|language=en-US}}</ref> The whole family surf, and her sisters and brother at times have also reached professional status. Coffey at times has competed with her sister for a spot on the elite Women's Surfing Championship Tour.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Weisman|first=Aly|title=These 5 beautiful siblings are known as the 'Kardashians of surfing'|url=https://www.insider.com/coffey-family-hot-surfer-siblings-2016-6|access-date=2021-12-17|website=Insider|date=7 May 2015 |language=en-US}}</ref>

== Career ==
Coffey won second place at the Junior World Surfing championships held in Panama in 2012.<ref name="Mychajlowycz"/><ref>{{Cite web|last=amministratore|date=2017-02-17|title=Ellie-Jean e sorelle: sono loro le surfiste più sexy del mondo!|url=https://newssportive.it/ellie-jean-sorelle-surfiste-sexy-1247|access-date=2021-12-17|website=NewsSportive.it|language=it-IT}}</ref>  The surfer tried single fin board, traditional style at the Single fin classic in 2015, and "dominated" the competition, despite not having used one previously<ref>{{Cite web|last=NEWS|first=NBN|date=2015-01-10|title=ELLIE-JEAN COFFEY SURPRISE SINGLE FIN NATURAL {{!}} NBN News|url=https://www.nbnnews.com.au/2015/01/10/ellie-jean-coffey-surprise-single-fin-natural/|access-date=2021-12-17|website=www.nbnnews.com.au|language=en-AU}}</ref> By 2017, Coffey was ranked 97th in the QS world rankings.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.worldsurfleague.com/athletes/2324/ellie-jean-coffey|title = Ellie-Jean Coffey Surfer Bio &#124; Age, Height, Videos & Results| date=February 2017 }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.dailytelegraph.com.au/sport/more-sports/surfer-elliejean-coffey-wants-to-be-known-as-more-than-a-bikini-babe/news-story/4d0dde9eee41606e7d98c315d1ea7faf|title=Bikini babe out to prove she's a hot surfer|date=5 February 2015|access-date=2016-09-15}}</ref> She is also a [[Model (person)|model]],<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.couriermail.com.au/sport/more-sports/surfer-elliejean-coffey-wants-to-be-known-as-more-than-a-bikini-babe/news-story/4d0dde9eee41606e7d98c315d1ea7faf|title=Surfer Ellie-Jean Coffey wants to be known as more than a bikini babe|date=5 February 2015|access-date=2016-09-15}}</ref> Increased attention being drawn to her social media raised her profile, resulting in her getting a number of sponsorship deals from surf-related fashion companies, including [[Billabong (clothing)|Billabong]],<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.gq-magazine.co.uk/article/ellie-jean-coffey-skateboard|title=This is the hottest Instagram post you've ever seen|last=GQ|language=en-GB|access-date=2016-09-15|archive-date=20 April 2016|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160420230732/http://www.gq-magazine.co.uk/article/ellie-jean-coffey-skateboard|url-status=dead}}</ref> Von Zipper and [[SurfStitch]]<ref name=":1"/> She has also published her own softcore images via her own website<ref name=":1"/>

Coffey has claimed that the surfing competition environment is misogynistic. She gave up on entering competitions after 2017. She has stated that surf community and competition contains a lot of negativity and even abuse towards women, and the many years she had spent in it had affected her, to the point where she had sought therapy.<ref>{{Cite web|date=2020-09-29|title=Surf's *Up* — 'Years Of Abuse' In Sports Industry Pushed Aussie Surfer Into Porn|url=https://okmagazine.com/news/ellie-jean-coffey-porn-years-abuse-surfing-industry/|access-date=2021-12-17|website=OK Magazine|language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last1=Bednall|first1=Jai|last2=News.com.au|date=2020-09-28|title=Ellie-Jean Coffey: Abuse in 'toxic' surfing world pushed me into porn life|url=https://nypost.com/2020/09/28/ellie-jean-coffey-abuse-in-toxic-surfing-world-pushed-me-into-porn-life/|access-date=2021-12-17|website=New York Post|language=en-US}}</ref> She still surfs, but only recreationally, and not in competitions.<ref>{{Cite news|last=Bednall|first=Jai|date=2020-09-27|title=Surf star reveals 'terrifying' abuse|work=news.com.au|url=https://www.news.com.au/sport/sports-life/elliejean-coffey-reveals-the-terrifying-abuse-she-suffered-in-surfing/news-story/ae94649e79d6698c8548c5762ab9def9|access-date=2021-12-17}}</ref>

