'''Indira Isabel Huilca Flores''' (born 11 August 1988) is a Peruvian politician serving as a member of the [[Chamber of Deputies (Peru)|Chamber of Deputies]] since 2026.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://diariocorreo.pe/politica/diputados-juran-por-aff-y-castillo-peru-fujimori-castillo-noticia/|title=Diputados juran por AFF y Castillo|work=[[Correo (newspaper)|Correo]]|date=25 July 2026|language=es}}</ref> From 2016 to 2020, she was a member of the unicameral [[Congress of the Republic of Peru|Congress of the Republic]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://larepublica.pe/domingo/2022/04/16/indira-huilca-el-gobierno-ha-dejado-de-lado-las-demandas-de-cambio|title=Indira Huilca: "El gobierno ha dejado de lado las demandas de cambio"|work=[[La República]]|date=17 April 2022|language=es}}</ref>

